abstract: >-
  A browser-based research tool comparing the IEEE C57.91 Clause 7 transformer
  thermal model with an extended model that adds absorbed solar heat and wind
  cooling, with calibration against measured top-oil temperatures.
keywords:
  - power transformer
  - thermal model
  - solar radiation
  - hot-spot temperature
  - insulation ageing
  - hot climate
